      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبَشُّ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, cheerful in countenance</i>].
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا رَأَيْتُ أَبَشَّ مِنْهُ بِاللَّاقِى</span> [<i>I have not
seen any one more cheerful in countenance than
he to the meeter</i>]. (A.)

